---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Railway Certification & Interoperability Services | Eurocert"
  description="EU Railway Interoperability Directive (TSI) certification, railway rolling stock and infrastructure safety audits by EUROCERT Asia."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/railway/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Railway certification,TSI certification,railway interoperability,rolling stock audit,railway safety"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367966/eurocert/c12.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25" alt="Railway Vehicles Welding"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">EN 15085 • TSI Compliance</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">EN 15085</h1><h3 class="heading-font text-white/70 text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Railway Vehicles Welding Certification</h3><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Internationally recognized standard ensuring the highest quality of safety and performance for welding on railway vehicles.</p><div class="mt-8"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/#contact">Click For Free Consultation <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Understanding the Standard</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">EN 15085?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">EN 15085 railway vehicles welding certification is a voluntary European standard for the welding of railway vehicles. First published in 2003 and revised in 2007, the standard covers the design, manufacture and testing of welded components and assemblies for use in railway vehicles. EN 15085 certification is granted by an independent third-party certification body.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-bullseye text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Purpose &amp; Scope</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The standard is designed to improve the safety, quality and reliability of railway vehicles. It covers the welding of all types of materials used in railway vehicles, including metals, plastics and composites. EN 15085 certification requires that welders are qualified to international standards, welding procedures are approved by an independent body, and welded components are tested to ensure they meet required strength and durability standards.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-100 bg-eurogold-50/30"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-user-check text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">For Welders &amp; Manufacturers</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Welders certified to EN 15085 can be confident that they have the skills and knowledge to produce high quality welds that meet safety requirements for railway vehicles. Manufacturers can be confident that components produced by certified welders will meet the required standards.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[480px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367966/eurocert/c12.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Railway Vehicles Welding"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Key Advantages</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Benefits of EN 15085 Certification</h2><p class="text-white/45 text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">EN 15085 certification is not required by law, but it is becoming increasingly common for manufacturers to seek it out due to the many benefits it provides.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Safety Assurance</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Demonstrates commitment to the highest quality of safety and performance in railway vehicle welding.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-trophy text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Competitive Advantage</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Provides a competitive edge in the marketplace  -  a must-have for any company taken seriously in the railway industry.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Customer Confidence</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Provides reassurance for both welders and manufacturers that their products are safe and fit for purpose.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-globe-europe text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Market Access</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Access to lucrative contracts in the European rail industry with certified systems and components.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Quality Demonstration</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Gives manufacturers a way to demonstrate their commitment to quality and safety to customers and regulators.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 group hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-check-double text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Standards Compliance</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Covers requirements for quality management, welding processes, and welder qualification in the railway industry.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Industry Standard</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Why is EN 15085 Important?</h2></div><div class="space-y-5"><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/40 to-white items-start"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">01</span></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">EN 15085 certified welders have demonstrated their ability to produce high quality welds that meet stringent European standards, providing assurance of consistent quality.</p></div><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/40 to-white items-start"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">02</span></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Certified welders can work on a variety of railway vehicles including passenger cars, freight cars, and locomotives  -  providing flexibility across projects.</p></div><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/40 to-white items-start"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">03</span></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Certified welders have completed extensive training and passed rigorous exams, demonstrating commitment to quality and safety.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Step by Step</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">How to Obtain EN 15085 Certification</h2><p class="text-white/45 text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">In order to obtain EN 15085 certification, welding companies must follow a structured process from application through to certificate issuance.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center relative"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm">01</span></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/5 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-file-signature text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Application</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Complete an application and submit it to the appropriate certification authority for review and approval.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center relative"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm">02</span></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/5 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-pen-fancy text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Written Exam</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Pass a written exam covering welding quality management, processes, and safety requirements.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center relative"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm">03</span></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/5 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-tools text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Evidence of Capability</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Provide evidence of welding capabilities through demonstrations and documented procedures.</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 text-center relative"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm">04</span></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/5 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Certificate Issued</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Upon passing the exam and providing evidence, receive a certificate of conformity.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Railway Certification Services</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Railway Certification &amp; Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Complete railway interoperability certification for systems, subsystems, and components under TSI requirements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive evaluation of railway components against Technical Specifications for Interoperability (TSI).</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert guidance on European railway standards, EN 15085 welding certification, and TSI compliance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous surveillance and monitoring to maintain railway interoperability certification compliance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center te